              "text": "சும — cuma — \"to carry; to bear a load\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நான் அந்த மூட்டையை வீடு வரை சுமந்தேன். nāṉ anta mūṭṭaiyai vīṭu varai cumantēṉ. I carried that sack all the way home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): சுமந்தேன், cumantēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is சுமை, a load; சும (cuma) is its verb, with the past in -ந்த-: சுமந்தேன்."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சும (cuma) is native Dravidian (DEDR 2677); the same article holds சுமை, \"a burden, a load\"."
